Package: iotc.core.gis.wkt
Type: Package
Title: IOTC core WKT and SF (simple feature) helpers and constants
Version: 0.2.1
Author: Fabio Fiorellato <fabio.fiorellato@fao.org>
Maintainer: Fabio Fiorellato <fabio.fiorellato@fao.org>
Description: Provides convenience methods to retrieve WKT data and produce SF out of these for the areas currently in the IOTC Statistics DB fishing grounds table, as well as constants to access the most frequently used areas, including:
    IO.EAST 
    IO.WEAST
    IO.BOTH
    IO.ALL
    IO.HS
    IO.EEZs
    IO.F51
    IO.F57
    IO.F5157
License: Private
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: 
    sf,
    iotc.core.utils.misc,
    iotc.core.db.data
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
